RentMaikar Unified Device Provisioning, Commissioning & Communication Architecture

Purpose

This document defines the standard architecture for provisioning, commissioning, communication, and lifecycle management of all telematics and IoT devices connected to the RentMaikar platform.

RentMaikar is the system of record and master orchestration platform for all organizations, fleet owners, vehicles, drivers, devices, and telematics services. External platforms such as Traccar, Hologram, and EMQX provide specialized services while remaining synchronized with RentMaikar.

---

Design Principles

- RentMaikar is the authoritative source of identity and orchestration.
- Every business entity receives a permanent UUID generated by RentMaikar.
- Hardware identifiers and network identifiers are treated as attributes, not primary business keys.
- Devices can be replaced without affecting vehicle records.
- Connectivity providers can be changed without affecting fleet records.
- All provisioning and commissioning processes shall be automated whenever possible.
- The architecture shall support multiple telematics vendors, multiple IoT carriers, and multiple countries.

