---

Vehicle Identity

Each listed vehicle receives a unique Vehicle UUID.

The Vehicle UUID is associated with:

- Fleet Owner
- Organization
- Fleet
- Registration Details
- Insurance
- Maintenance History
- Inspection Records
- Rental History
- Driver Assignments
- Current Device UUID
- Live Operational Status

The Vehicle UUID remains unchanged even if ownership, telematics hardware, or mobile network subscriptions change.

---

Device Identity

Each telematics device receives a unique Device UUID.

Associated identifiers include:

Identifier| Purpose
Device UUID| Internal permanent identity
IMEI| Physical device identifier
EID| Embedded eSIM identifier
ICCID| Active SIM/eSIM profile
IMSI| Subscriber identity
MSISDN| Assigned phone number (optional)
Traccar Device ID| Traccar mapping
Hologram Device ID| Connectivity management
MQTT Client ID| EMQX authentication
Manufacturer| Device vendor
Model| Hardware model
Firmware Version| Software version
Certificates| Device security credentials

Device UUIDs remain constant throughout the life of the hardware.

---

Remote eSIM Provisioning

Provisioning is managed through Hologram using GSMA Remote SIM Provisioning (RSP).

Provisioning Workflow

1. Register telematics device.
2. Read device IMEI.
3. Read device EID.
4. Generate Device UUID.
5. Associate Device UUID with Vehicle UUID.
6. Request an eSIM profile from Hologram.
7. Download the eSIM profile remotely.
8. Receive ICCID.
9. Receive IMSI.
10. Receive MSISDN (when available).
11. Activate cellular connectivity.
12. Store all provisioning metadata in RentMaikar.
13. Audit and log the provisioning operation.

The EID is the primary identifier used for remote eSIM profile installation.

---

Device Commissioning

Once provisioning is complete, the commissioning process begins automatically.

Commissioning includes:

- APN configuration
- Network authentication
- MQTT configuration
- TLS certificate installation
- EMQX registration
- Traccar endpoint configuration
- OTA update policy
- Security policy deployment
- GPS reporting interval
- Heartbeat interval
- Telemetry configuration
- Device health monitoring

Successful commissioning changes the device state to:

READY
CONNECTED
AUTHENTICATED
TRACKING_ENABLED

