Security Requirements

- Every device must authenticate before transmitting data.
- All MQTT traffic must use TLS encryption.
- Device credentials shall be rotated when required.
- Every provisioning and commissioning event shall be audit logged.
- All API calls shall require authenticated and authorized access.
- Devices shall be remotely suspendable or decommissioned.
- OTA updates shall be cryptographically verified before installation.

