---

Summary

RentMaikar serves as the central orchestration platform for identity, provisioning, commissioning, communication, and lifecycle management. Traccar provides telematics, Hologram delivers cellular connectivity and eSIM lifecycle services, and EMQX manages secure real-time messaging. By separating immutable business UUIDs from hardware and network identifiers, the platform remains resilient to device replacements, carrier migrations, ownership changes, and future technology evolution while maintaining a consistent operational model across all connected vehicles and fleets.
